<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' />
    <title>Account Verification - Craft Market 3D</title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333333;
      margin: 0; padding: 0; } .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 20px; } .header { text-align: center; padding: 20px 0;
      background-color: #f8f9fa; } .logo { max-width: 200px; height: auto; }
      .content { padding: 30px 20px; background-color: #ffffff; }
      .verification-code { background-color: #f5f5f5; padding: 15px; margin:
      20px 0; text-align: center; font-size: 24px; letter-spacing: 5px;
      font-weight: bold; } .button { display: inline-block; padding: 12px 30px;
      background-color: #4CAF50; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 5px; margin: 20px 0; text-align: center; } .footer {
      text-align: center; padding: 20px; font-size: 12px; color: #666666;
      border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee; margin-top: 30px; } .note { font-size:
      12px; color: #666666; margin-top: 20px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class='container'>
      <div class='header'>
        <img src='{{logoUrl}}' alt='Craft Market 3D Logo' class='logo' />
      </div>

      <div class='content'>
        <h2>Welcome to Craft Market 3D!</h2>

        <p>Dear {{userName}},</p>

        <p>Thank you for creating an account at Craft Market 3D - your premier
          destination for 3D digital assets. We're excited to have you join our
          creative community!</p>

        <p>To complete your registration, please verify your email address using
          one of the following methods:</p>

        <p><strong>Option 1:</strong>
          Enter this verification code in the app:</p>

        <div class='verification-code'>
          {{verificationToken}}
        </div>

        <p><strong>Option 2:</strong>
          Click the button below to verify instantly:</p>

        <div style='text-align: center;'>
          <a href='{{verificationLink}}' class='button'>Verify My Account</a>
        </div>

        <p class='note'>This verification link and code will expire in 24 hours.
          If you didn't create an account with Craft Market 3D, please ignore
          this email.</p>
      </div>

      <div class='footer'>
        <p>© {{currentYear}} Craft Market 3D. All rights reserved.</p>
        <p>This is an automated message, please do not reply to this email.</p>
        <p>
          <a href='{{privacyPolicyUrl}}'>Privacy Policy</a>
          |
          <a href='{{termsUrl}}'>Terms of Service</a>
          |
          <a href='{{supportUrl}}'>Contact Support</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>